Requirements: 21   with obligations: 20   deliberately none: 1

[task-01] No test's outcome or case list depends on the task file at the repository
    root, which is a scratch input rewritten for every task.
    -> root-task-file-ignored-by-tests  [invariant/explicit]
       No test's outcome or case list depends on the task file at the repository root,
       which is a scratch input rewritten for every task.

[constraint-01] No test reads the task file at the repository root.
    -> no-root-task-file-read  [functional/explicit]
       No test reads the task file at the repository root.

[constraint-02] The task-file parse test takes its inputs from the committed task files
    under `dogfood-logs/`.
    -> parse-test-inputs-from-committed-task-files  [functional/explicit]
       The task-file parse test takes its inputs from the committed task files under
       `dogfood-logs/`.

[constraint-03] The parse test runs one case per committed task file.
    -> parse-test-one-case-per-committed-file  [functional/explicit]
       The parse test runs one case per committed task file.

[constraint-04] The parse test asserts, for each case, that the parsed behavior,
    constraints and completion expectations are each non-empty.
    -> parse-test-nonempty-sections  [test_demand/explicit]
       The parse test asserts that, for each case, the parsed behavior, constraints, and
       completion expectations are each non-empty.

[constraint-05] The parse test asserts, for each case, that every parsed span reproduces
    its own text from the source it was parsed from.
    -> parse-test-span-roundtrip  [test_demand/explicit]
       The parse test asserts that, for each case, every parsed span reproduces its own
       text from the source it was parsed from.

[constraint-06] The region-coverage case list is built only from the committed task
    files under `dogfood-logs/`.
    -> region-coverage-inputs-from-committed-task-files  [functional/explicit]
       The region-coverage case list is built only from the committed task files under
       `dogfood-logs/`.

[constraint-07] The region-coverage case list is non-empty.
    -> region-coverage-case-list-non-empty-2  [boundary/explicit]
       The region-coverage case list is non-empty.

[constraint-08] The region-coverage case list omits a path that is not present in the
    tree.
    -> region-coverage-omits-missing-path  [boundary/explicit]
       The region-coverage case list omits a path that is not present in the tree.

[constraint-09] A test run reports no failures when no task file is present at the
    repository root.
    -> no-failures-without-root-task-file  [regression/explicit]
       A test run reports no failures when no task file is present at the repository
       root.

[constraint-10] The parse test's documentation states which inputs it covers.
    -> parse-test-docs-state-covered-inputs  [docs_config/explicit]
       The parse test's documentation states which inputs it covers.

[exclusion-01] Whether the task file at the repository root is tracked by version
    control.
    -> root-task-file-version-control-untouched  [compatibility/explicit]
       The change does not alter whether the task file at the repository root is tracked
       by version control.

[exclusion-02] How a task file is parsed into sections.
    -> exclude-task-file-parsing  [functional/explicit]
       The change does not alter how a task file is parsed into sections.

[exclusion-03] How region coverage is computed.
    -> exclude-region-coverage-computation  [functional/explicit]
       The change does not alter how region coverage is computed.

[exclusion-04] Which sections a task file is required to contain.
    -> exclude-required-sections  [functional/explicit]
       The change does not alter which sections a task file is required to contain.

[exclusion-05] The content of the committed task files.
    -> exclude-committed-task-file-content  [functional/explicit]
       The change does not alter the content of the committed task files.

